        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The horizontal technologies we develop are essential to support a variety of use cases across several vertical market segments that use connected devices such as mobile phones, automobiles and autonomous vehicles, wearables, smart factories and smart homes, robots, drones and many other connected consumer electronic products including tablets and PCs.",
